tour feature-open-linked-tour
kind flow
author ai
group features/gui
note A step with a link shows the linked tour's name as a button (→ name); clicking it opens that tour in the document. The reader reaches for it to follow a link to the shared tour it names instead of hunting for that tour in the Tours list. Under a tour's note, 'linked from' lists every step in other tours that links here; clicking one selects that step in its own tour. A link to a tour that no longer exists shows as red (missing) and cannot be clicked.

